  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The agent is trained in special techniques by their organization to move unnoticed wherever they are needed. At 1st level, the agent chooses a ploy from the options at the end of the class description. The agent’s ploy grants a bonus skill sphere and a new ability.</p>\n<p><strong>Author's Note:</strong> In the case of ploys which grant a combat sphere, the agent uses their operative modifier as their practitioner modifier.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/agent#toc4\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
